{"title": "Contagion", "pageid": 8412, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Contagion", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 5 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Melee spell attacks", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Contagion_Filth_Fever.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Contagion_Filth_Fever.webp/300px-Contagion_Filth_Fever.webp, /w/images/4/46/Contagion_Filth_Fever.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Contagion_Filth_Fever.webp/300px-Contagion_Filth_Fever.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Contagion_Filth_Fever.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Contagion </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 5 necromancy spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to infect their target with an affliction of their choosing, potentially resulting in the target contracting a disease.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Poison a target and possibly afflict them with a disease of your choice.\n</p>\nOnce infected, the target will roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> each turn. If it accumulates 3 successes, it recovers. If it accumulates 3 failures, it contracts the disease chosen by the spellcaster.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 5 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Spell Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Spell <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Contagion</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Contagion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Contagion\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Filth_Fever\" title=\"Contagion: Filth Fever\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/80px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Filth Fever\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Filth_Fever\" title=\"Contagion: Filth Fever\">Contagion: Filth Fever</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Flesh_Rot\" title=\"Contagion: Flesh Rot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/80px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Flesh Rot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Flesh_Rot\" title=\"Contagion: Flesh Rot\">Contagion: Flesh Rot</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Slimy_Doom\" title=\"Contagion: Slimy Doom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp/80px-Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Slimy Doom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Contagion_Slimy_Doom_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Slimy_Doom\" title=\"Contagion: Slimy Doom\">Contagion: Slimy Doom</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Seizure\" title=\"Contagion: Seizure\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp/80px-Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Seizure\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Contagion_Seizure_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Seizure\" title=\"Contagion: Seizure\">Contagion: Seizure</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Mindfire\" title=\"Contagion: Mindfire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/80px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Mindfire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Mindfire\" title=\"Contagion: Mindfire\">Contagion: Mindfire</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Blinding_Sickness\" title=\"Contagion: Blinding Sickness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/80px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Blinding Sickness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Blinding_Sickness\" title=\"Contagion: Blinding Sickness\">Contagion: Blinding Sickness</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Contagion_Poisoned\"> Condition: Contagion Poisoned </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion_Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Contagion Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion_Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Contagion Poisoned (Condition)\">Contagion Poisoned</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>.</li>\n<li>Each turn, it must succeed on a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, or the poison will advance in stage. On 3 successes, it recovers. On 3 failures, it contracts the disease corresponding to the variant of the spell <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Contagion</a> that was cast.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 9: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Spores\" title=\"Circle of the Spores\">Circle of the Spores</a> (Circle Spell), <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Land\" title=\"Circle of the Land\">Circle of the Land</a> (Arctic/Forest/Underdark), and <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Domain\" title=\"Death Domain\">Death Domain</a> (Domain Spell)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>After this spell hits, the target is only affected by the less potent Contagion Poisoned condition until it fails 3 saving throws. Then the selected variant of disease sets in and persists after a long rest, essentially forever. To remove this, heal the target with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lesser_Restoration\" title=\"Lesser Restoration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp/20px-Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp/30px-Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp/40px-Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lesser Restoration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp/20px-Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Lesser_Restoration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lesser_Restoration\" title=\"Lesser Restoration\">Lesser Restoration</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)#Removal\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\">similar effect</a>.</li>\n<li>Casting Contagion outside of battle on any NPC is not considered an aggressive action.\n<ul><li>However, missing the attack roll when casting the spell <i>is</i> considered aggressive and might turn NPCs hostile.</li>\n<li>After contracting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Mindfire\" title=\"Contagion: Mindfire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/20px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Mindfire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/20px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Mindfire\" title=\"Contagion: Mindfire\">Contagion: Mindfire</a>, NPCs turn <a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to everyone permanently which may be undesirable for key quest NPCs.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The conditions inflicted by the different variants of the spell do not share <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack IDs</a>. This means a target can be affected by multiple distinct contagions at the same time.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Contagion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Contagion\">Contagion</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034642\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4598/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 73265/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 28031/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1621746/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n112.21%   87.469     49 Template:Trim\n100.00%   77.954      1 -total\n 97.48%   75.992      1 Template:Feature_page\n 26.53%   20.683     14 Template:Icon_text\n 19.62%   15.292     10 Template:Icon_link\n 14.67%   11.433      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.61%   11.385      1 Template:Condition\n 12.70%    9.903      6 Template:SAI\n  9.41%    7.336      1 Template:Resource\n  8.85%    6.895      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8412-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034642 and revision id 363093. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}